rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/deployments","created_at":"2010-02-08T13:20:56Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T09:11:32Z","pushed_at":"2026-03-09T09:11:24Z","git_url":"git://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:elastic/elasticsearch.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch","homepage":"https://www.elastic.co/products/elasticsearch","size":1565901,"stargazers_count":76300,"watchers_count":76300,"language":"Java","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":25807,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":5586,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["elasticsearch","java","search-engine"],"visibility":"public","forks":25807,"open_issues":5586,"watchers":76300,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"This meta issue tracks our work on ANN search. It is not an exhaustive plan and items might be changed/ added over time.\n\n### Features\n- [x] #81788 @jtibshirani \n- [x] https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/87625 @jtibshirani \n- [x] https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/84929\n- [x] Support other vector element types\n  * https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/48322\n  * https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/89784\n- [ ] #72068\n- [x] Support sparse vectors of terms with fractional weights (for approaches like SPLADE)\n- [ ] Add support for ANN algorithm that does not require all vectors to be held in memory (?)\n- [ ] ~~Can we remove need for tuning by automatically choosing good index + search parameters (?)~~\n- [x] Investigate support for \"maximum inner product search\" (dot product similarity with unnormalized vectors)\n\n### Enhancements\n- [x] https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/84801\n- [x] https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/89561\n- [x] https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/89713\n- [x] https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/90323\n- [x] https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/87490 @jtibshirani \n- [x] https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/91187\n- [x] https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/91260\n- [x] Ability to measure recall of ANN query by comparing to exact scan\n- [x] Support for reciprocal rank fusion to combine traditional query and ANN results\n- [ ] https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/91526\n- [x] https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/91527\n- [ ] https://github.com/elastic/rally-tracks/issues/408\n- [ ] https://github.com/elastic/rally-tracks/issues/407\n- [x] https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/96779\n\n### Performance improvements\n**Search performance**\n  - [x] [Handle hierarchy in HNSW graph](https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/LUCENE-10054) @mayya-sharipova \n  - [x] [Streamline lookups in case when all docs have a vector](https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/LUCENE-10408) @mayya-sharipova \n  - [x] [Investigate recall gap between Lucene and hnswlib](https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/LUCENE-9937) (resolved in [LUCENE-10527](https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/LUCENE-10527), available in ES 8.3)\n  - [x] https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/89782\n  - [ ] https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/90700\n  - [ ] https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/88921\n\n**Indexing performance**\n  - [x] [Speed up HNSW flush + merge by writing vectors to file](https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/LUCENE-10375) @jtibshirani \n  - [x] [Reuse data structures across HnswGraph invocations](https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/LUCENE-10391) @jtibshirani\n  - [x] [Reexamine graph diversity checks](https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/LUCENE-9848)\n  - [x] Build HNSW graph during indexing instead of on flush ([LUCENE-10592](https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/LUCENE-10592), available in ES 8.5)\n  - [x] [Reuse HNSW graphs when merging segments?](https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/LUCENE-10318)\n\n### Tech Debt\n- [x] Revisit our temporary workaround class PerFieldKnnVectorsFormatFieldMapper?\n- [x] https://github.com/elastic/rally-tracks/issues/234\n- [x] https://github.com/elastic/rally/issues/1549\n- [x] https://github.com/apache/lucene/issues/10665\n- [x] https://github.com/apache/lucene/issues/11758\n- [x] [Remove VectorValues#randomAccess](https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/LUCENE-9583)\n- [x] [Remove VectorValues#binaryValue](https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/LUCENE-10175)\n- [ ] [Revisit design of VectorSimilarityFunction](https://github.com/apache/lucene/issues/11228)\n- [ ] https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/91523","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/84324/reactions","total_count":22,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":11,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearc